### Simplified Chinese machine translation of `../en/zones.ftl` (2026-11-01), a baseline for a
### translator to correct. The English file says which part of which place each name is; `$place`
### is the game's own name for the place, read from the ROM. A name missing here is said in English.

part-0x2e = { $place }北部
part-0x2f = { $place }南部
part-0x30 = { $place }
part-0x31 = { $place }高地
part-0xdb = { $place }西北
part-0xdc = { $place }东北
part-0xdd = { $place }西南
part-0xde = { $place }东南
part-0x1dd = { $place }西北树果田
part-0x211 = { $place }东北树果田
part-0x212 = { $place }西南树果田
part-0x213 = { $place }东南树果田
